# Scoped to source/end2end-tests/web-ui/Dockerfile.ui-runner only.
# BuildKit picks up <dockerfile>.dockerignore alongside the Dockerfile
# and uses it in preference to any context-root .dockerignore.
#
# The runner image only needs this package. Everything else in the repo
# is noise — keep the build context small to skip the multi-second send
# step when the build is otherwise cache-hit.

*

!source/end2end-tests/web-ui/

**/node_modules/
**/.yarn/cache/
**/.yarn/install-state.gz
**/dist/
**/target/
**/.DS_Store
.git/
